 "title": "Covering compatibility for universal homeomorphisms",
 "statement": "Let $u:X_0\\to X$ be a universal homeomorphism. A family $\\{U_i\\to U\\}$ of\netale $X$-schemes is jointly surjective if and only if its base change along\n$u$ is jointly surjective.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-proper-base-change/sk-thm-p1/lemma-weil-pbc-universal-homeomorphism-coverings.md",
  "place": "node lemma-weil-pbc-universal-homeomorphism-coverings, order 1111",
